  <History Date="07-12-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (documentation is a mess.  blue controls are duplicate - assumed second is actually white.  continuous pan/tilt functions are included in the main p/t controls as well as separate controls.  this looks wrong)" Version="0" />
